-- the hop's gravitational factor along p, after H_p of side sp, on the vertex's states:
-- Σ over the other pairs m < n of ε(m,n,p)(Φ(m,n) − Φ(n,m)); ε(m,n,0) = ε(0,m,n), a cyclic shift
hop-pair : List Triple → VM → Nat → Nat → SQ → List Nat → Rows → List Term
hop-pair ts aP m n s dsP xs0 = terms-append (hop-kinds s ts aP 5 n m dsP xs0) (hop-kinds (sq-neg s) ts aP 5 m n dsP xs0)
